Enable themes and keyboard-shortcut tray in the Tauri desktop app

Wire up two web-app features that were missing from the desktop wrapper:
- View > Theme native menu (Default/Classic/Gray/Green/Turquoise/Dark),
  forwarded to Elm as a ThemeChanged Incoming message and applied via
  the existing Page.Doc.Theme; persisted per-file and restored on open.
- Doc.UI.viewShortcuts tray, with its toggle persisted per-file via
  SaveUserSetting ("shortcutTrayOpen").

